# --- Next.js (per S2.1 init, 2026-10-06) ---
**/.next
**/next-env.d.ts
**/dist
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# TypeScript incremental build cache (generated by `tsc --incremental` or Next.js)
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# trailing-slash form **/.next/ is gitignore-parser-buggy when followed by
# a comment; use **/.next (no slash) instead — matches dir + contents recursively

